# EXCEPTION — the scratch payload Hyprland runs via its on_created_empty workspace
# rule (~/.config/hypr/hyprland.lua). `.local/` above buries the whole dir
# (machine state: share/state/var/lib/...), and git will NOT descend into an
# excluded dir, so the re-include is spelled in this ORDER on purpose: open the
# dir, re-bury everything inside, then hand-pick the payload out again. Last
# match wins — reorder at your own risk. Its `.bak` hand-snapshot stays buried
# with every other such copy (the repo's convention: git history supersedes the
# file copy); `rm ~/.local/bin/.dms-scratch.bak` if you want it gone.
!.local/
.local/**
!.local/bin/
!.local/bin/dms-scratch

.cargo/
.mozilla/
.openjfx/
.pki/
.pi/agent/logs/
.pi/agent/models-store.json
.pi/agent/pi-crash.log
.pi/agent/**/*.bak
.pi/agent/**/*.disabled
.config/maya/*.log
.config/llamacpp/*.bak*
